  "limitations": "One turn, one spawn shape, one claude version, one model (haiku). Cross-version and cross-surface stability are UNMEASURED. The census is a census of THIS turn: a subtype listed in expected_absent did not appear here, which is not the same as claude never emitting it. #1218 measured one subtype's rate as surface-dependent (ptyrunner emits zero system/thinking_tokens, streamrunner ~10/turn), so model- and surface-dependence are live possibilities, not ruled-out ones.",
